-  NetraVaani device firmware for Upside Down Labs NPG Lite (ESP32-C6) + Proto Playmate
+  NetraVaani device firmware nv-1.1.0
+  Upside Down Labs NPG Lite (ESP32-C6) on the Proto Playmate. No external parts.
 
